comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-09T04:24:20.123Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: native command node placement preserves existing SDK handlers; bootstrap aliases, runtime contracts, capability routing, package availability, positional addressing, and three shell completions share declared mappings. TDD reproduced missing namespace support, then verified native/legacy argv and real isolated tracker reads. Broader quality gates and package acceptance are in progress."
  "2026-09-09T04:42:08.994Z","harness:codex","Verification update: focused native/legacy and help/contract suite exercised 271 cases; 270 passed and one obsolete package-hint expectation was corrected. Native JSON help now retains optional-package installation recovery. GitHub live inventory found no open issues or PRs and no open Dependabot/code-scanning/secret-scanning alerts. Full coverage and static gates must finish before closure."
  "2026-09-09T04:56:37.711Z","harness:codex","Manual acceptance passed in a disposable workspace using real search-advanced and governance-audit packages: ops reindex keyword refresh, ops normalize dry-run, five native/legacy JSON output comparisons, focus persistence and history verification. Scoped native contract reads now include the package descriptor; unavailable native JSON help includes package installation recovery."
  "2026-09-09T05:15:39.213Z","harness:codex","Verification: linked sandbox-safe suite passed 42 tests across 8 files. Real search-advanced reindex and governance-audit normalize dry-run succeeded after package installation in an isolated workspace. Native and legacy JSON/help contracts, missing-provider recovery hints, default item history, and history events passed. Independent npm/Bun tarball installs resolved both public SDK entrypoints and native command paths."
  "2026-09-09T05:29:24.692Z","harness:codex","Final verification: 8639 tests in 655 files passed; exact coverage 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts (63818 statements, 48528 branches, 13248 functions, 61196 lines). Full static gates and source documentation requirements passed without relaxed thresholds. Linked suites, typecheck, secret scan, native/legacy temporary-workspace acceptance, real package installation, independent npm/Bun SDK consumers, and npx/bunx packed smoke with 13 packages passed. GitHub issue/PR and security alert inventories were clear before opening this delivery PR."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-09T05:19:58.494Z","harness:codex","Install namespace placement after package registration, move the existing Commander node, and resolve contracts through the stable operation identity. This preserves optional package boundaries and avoids cloned handler/parser drift."
